        <mxCell id="5KvPcHEuP_JT7qR7lmdT-85" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=0;spacingLeft=26;spacingTop=12;" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Back of the Envelope Estimation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3146&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Suppose TinyURL receives:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;10 million new URLs per day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3189&quot; data-end=&quot;3209&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Read-to-write ratio:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;100 : 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3232&quot; data-end=&quot;3317&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;This means that for every one URL created, approximately 100 redirect requests occur.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3319&quot; data-end=&quot;3350&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Average size of one URL record:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;500 bytes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3375&quot; data-end=&quot;3390&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Data retention&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5 years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3375&quot; data-end=&quot;3390&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;torage estimation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3953&quot; data-end=&quot;3968&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;One URL record:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;500 bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3993&quot; data-end=&quot;4014&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;URLs created per day&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;10 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4040&quot; data-end=&quot;4056&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Storage per day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;10,000,000 × 500 bytes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;= 5,000,000,000 bytes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;≈ 5 GB per day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4131&quot; data-end=&quot;4148&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Storage per year:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5 GB × 365&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;≈ 1,825 GB&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;≈ 1.8 TB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4194&quot; data-end=&quot;4217&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Storage for five years:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1.8 TB × 5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;≈ 9 TB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4250&quot; data-end=&quot;4286&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;So the platform needs approximately:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;9–10 TB storage for five years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
